Time</span> <span begin="01:09.159" end="01:09.454">is</span> <span begin="01:09.454" end="01:10.221">up!</span> <span begin="01:10.565" end="01:10.890">Go</span> <span begin="01:10.890" end="01:11.910">grab</span> <span begin="01:11.910" end="01:12.258">your</span> <span begin="01:12.258" end="01:13.227">arms!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">时间紧迫！拿起武器！</span></p><p begin="01:13.593" end="01:16.274" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="01:13.593" end="01:13.697">No</span> <span begin="01:13.697" end="01:14.071">mat</span><span begin="01:14.071" end="01:14.239">ter</span> <span begin="01:14.239" end="01:14.580">how</span> <span begin="01:14.580" end="01:14.961">hard</span> <span begin="01:14.961" end="01:15.359">we</span> <span begin="01:15.359" end="01:15.793">have</span> <span begin="01:15.793" end="01:16.274">been</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">无论我们经历了多少艰难困苦</span></p><p begin="01:16.553" end="01:19.530" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="01:16.553" end="01:16.871">We</span> <span begin="01:16.871" end="01:17.013">shall</span> <span begin="01:17.013" end="01:17.535">fight</span> <span begin="01:17.535" end="01:17.993">for-</span><span begin="01:17.993" end="01:18.668">E-</span><span begin="01:18.668" end="01:19.530">VER!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我们必须一直斗争下去！</span></p><p begin="01:30.219" end="01:32.953" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="01:30.219" end="01:30.619">I</span> <span begin="01:30.619" end="01:30.985">hear</span> <span begin="01:30.985" end="01:31.350">it</span> <span begin="01:31.350" end="01:31.715">from</span> <span begin="01:31.715" end="01:32.419">no</span> <span begin="01:32.419" end="01:32.953">one</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我在冥冥之中听到一个声音</span></p><p begin="01:33.241" end="01:35.663" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="01:33.241" end="01:33.369">It</span> <span begin="01:33.369" end="01:33.511">oc</span><span be