3:27.093">have</span> <span begin="03:27.093" end="03:27.427">said</span> <span begin="03:27.427" end="03:28.075">no</span> <span begin="03:28.075" end="03:28.700">word</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">他虽不曾言明</span></p><p begin="03:28.915" end="03:32.177" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L36"><span begin="03:28.915" end="03:29.241">But</span> <span begin="03:29.241" end="03:29.542">I</span> <span begin="03:29.542" end="03:29.669">have</span> <span begin="03:29.669" end="03:29.827">to</span> <span begin="03:29.827" end="03:30.243">keep</span> <span begin="03:30.243" end="03:30.899">know</span><span begin="03:30.899" end="03:32.177">ing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但我却时刻铭记</span></p></div></body></tt>
